#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:5
msgid "Refunds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:8
msgid "On this page:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:11
msgid "Refund an online payment made using Taler"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:13
msgid ""
"To make a refund to a payment made using Taler, you first have to find "
"the payment you wish to refund."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:15
msgid ""
"For Odoo 18, in the ``invoicing`` add-on, navigate to ``Customers -> "
"Customer Payments`` on the top bar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:16
msgid "For Odoo 19, the location is ``Customers -> Payments``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:18
msgid "This page will show you all the payments that have been completed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:19
msgid "In this example, we want to refund the payment ``PBNK1/2026/00029``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:20
msgid ""
"For a more technical option, activate the developper mode in the "
"settings, navigate to ``Configuration -> Payment Transactions`` on the "
"top bar, selecte a transaction, and click on the payment in the "
"``payment`` field on the transaction’s page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:25
msgid "Click on the payment that you would like to start the refund process for."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:27
msgid ""
"On the payment page, click ``Refund`` in the action button section (top-"
"left) and confirm the refund."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:-1
msgid "Taler payment page"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:-1
msgid ".. image:: ../images/EN/Taler_refund_payment.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../images/FR/Taler_refund_payment.png"

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:35
msgid ""
"You can set the amount you'd like to refund. The refund amount cannot be "
"higher than the transaction amount."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:37
msgid ""
"You can make multiple partial refunds (for example, a 30 euros "
"transaction can be refunded by 5 euros, and then by 10 euros later)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:38
msgid ""
"In case of partial refunds, the total refunded amount across multiple "
"refunds of one transaction cannot exceed the transaction amount."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:39
msgid ""
"The refunded customer will receive one refund email per partial refund, "
"with each containing a different QR Code to be scanned into their wallet."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:41
msgid ""
"Confirming the refund will create a new transaction, that you can view in"
" the list of transactions, with the name ``R-{Odoo reference number}``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:45
msgid ""
"An email containing the refund QR Code will also be sent to the "
"customer’s email address."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:48
msgid ""
"You can view this email in the list of sent emails, found in ``Settings "
"app -> Technical -> Emails``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:51
msgid ""
"You may need to activate Odoo’s ``Developer`` mode (found in the "
"settings) to access the ``Technical`` tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:54
msgid ""
"To receive the refund, the customer will have to scan the QR Code with "
"their Taler wallet."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:-1
msgid "Taler refund email to customer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:-1
msgid ".. image:: ../images/EN/Taler_refund_email.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../images/FR/Taler_refund_email.png"

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:63
msgid "You need a functional email sender for this feature to work properly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:64
msgid ""
"Without an email sender, the email will be generated and can be read, but"
" it will not be sent."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/refunds.rst:65
msgid ""
"You can only do full refunds using Taler. Partial refunds are not "
"implemented."
msgstr ""

